MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

wenshu is derived from hermes-agent (Nous Research) and the welcome
screen must keep the upstream attribution. R28 rename overshot this
single line; restore the upstream-style "基于 Hermes 修改而来"
phrasing per the user-confirmed hermes allowlist.

Add wenshu-pour/architecture/hermes-allowlist-2026-08-29.md
documenting the explicit allowlist (welcome.tsx) and the implicit
upstream-keep list (hermes-agent.nousresearch.com URLs, NousResearch
fork, MIT copyright, node_modules, etc.) so future renames never
overshoot the same line twice.

